    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-of-a-kind experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODULE is the first ever <i>true</i> anti-platformer; as it allows you to control the <strong>entire level</strong>, rather than a single subject in order to reach the goal. With just two buttons, you can navigate your way through challenging and cleverly designed levels by turning on and off various stage elements, all while avoiding obstacles along the way. If you love optimizing speedruns or just a good challenge, then you'll definitely want to join the MODULE neo-hacker program.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be creative!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game level editor to create your own awesome levels, with many tools at your disposal in order to fine tune the experience and create a satisfying gameplay experience.  Share your levels with the world and see how many levels you can complete yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calling all speed-runners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODULE uses a<strong> deterministic</strong>\u00a0physics engine, which means consistent, satisfying gameplay. It also means every small decision matters, so optimizing a level for the best time is extra rewarding. Find the best path and be number one on the leaderboards!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-of-a-kind experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODULE is the first ever <i>true</i> anti-platformer; as it allows you to control the <strong>entire level</strong>, rather than a single subject in order to reach the goal. With just two buttons, you can navigate your way through challenging and cleverly designed levels by turning on and off various stage elements, all while avoiding obstacles along the way. If you love optimizing speedruns or just a good challenge, then you'll definitely want to join the MODULE neo-hacker program.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be creative!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game level editor to create your own awesome levels, with many tools at your disposal in order to fine tune the experience and create a satisfying gameplay experience.  Share your levels with the world and see how many levels you can complete yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calling all speed-runners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODULE uses a<strong> deterministic</strong>\u00a0physics engine, which means consistent, satisfying gameplay. It also means every small decision matters, so optimizing a level for the best time is extra rewarding. Find the best path and be number one on the leaderboards!</p>",
